<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dispel Good</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 39), Dark Knight (guild level 45)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast dispel good &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast dispel good</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A dark prayer that strikes at the life force of a good being. The target must 
be of good alignment, and you must not be good yourself; otherwise the spell 
fails. The better your divine power and sphere, the harder it strikes.
</p><p>If the target is warded by protection from evil, the first cast only breaks 
that ward. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on 
staffs and scrolls. Its bright twin, for those of good heart, is 
<a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Evil</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection from Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>